# Code owners for Activity Tracker.
#
# Every path is owned by the repository owner. GitHub requests review from the
# owner automatically on any pull request touching a matching path.
#
# Note: a code owner cannot approve their own pull request. Keep
# "Require review from Code Owners" OFF in branch protection while this is a
# solo repository, or you will be unable to merge your own work.

# Everything.
* @jasecena

# Release pipeline and security posture — the parts where a bad change is
# expensive and the blast radius reaches Apple credentials.
/.github/workflows/  @jasecena
/.github/scripts/    @jasecena
/.gitleaks.toml      @jasecena
/SECURITY.md         @jasecena

# The segmentation engine. All correctness lives here; it is the one place
# where a subtle change is worth reading twice.
/src/core/           @jasecena

# The only file that may touch Core Location, and the one whose bugs cost
# battery rather than pixels.
/src/services/       @jasecena
